@HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register (201 the first time, 409 if you run it again)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Alice"
}

### Register with bad input (400 with validation errors)
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short",
  "displayName": ""
}

### Login – copy "token" from the response into @token below
# @name login
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login with a wrong password (401). Run it 6 times in a minute → 429.
POST {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

###
@token = paste-your-token-here

### Me with the token (200 + your user)
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Me without a token (401)
GET {{HabitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
